  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["Cl", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "0"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "938e4d41-7675-4d94-b248-f6fc962123ff"],
 " first let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s look how this algebra factorizes into above \
listed elementary representations"
}], "Text",
