Cell["\<\
It is easy to see, that subtraction gives all zero matrices, meaning that \
both multiplication tables exactly coincides. An alternative way using \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IdealBasis\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] method\
\>", "Text",
