Cell[TextData[{
 "if we prefer complex matrices (option ",
 StyleBox["TargetMatrices\[Rule]Complex",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "). This particular option simply sorts vectors by sign of their square, i.\
\[DoubleStruckE] matrices which squares to +1 goes first, then -1, and then \
inside each group sorts by ",
 StyleBox["complexes",
  IgnoreSpellCheck->True],
 "/reals property (i.e. real or complex matrices are preferred. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
