with \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuaternionIsomorphismRules\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\[Rule]{\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]HH2R4\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]}\
\>", "Text",
