 TemplateBox[{
  "gaDefineMatrixRepresentation", "isomorphismIRule", 
   "\"Warning. Imaginary unit replacement \\\"IToRealMatrix\\\" was applied. \
It replaces explicitly elements \[PlusMinus]1 and \[PlusMinus]\[ImaginaryI]. \
